* LM27762_OPEN / LM27762_OPEN_AVG - open behavioural model of a dual-output
* (positive LDO + inverting charge pump + negative LDO) power supply
* License: CC-BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)
* Clean-room model: built only from FACTS.md (datasheet facts); no vendor SPICE model was consulted.
*
* Pin order of both variants (and the datasheet pin each one is):
*   .subckt LM27762_OPEN     VIN GND OUTP FBP OUTN FBN CPOUT C1P C1N ENP ENN PGOOD
*   .subckt LM27762_OPEN_AVG VIN GND OUTP FBP OUTN FBN CPOUT C1P C1N ENP ENN PGOOD
*     VIN=VIN(3)  GND=GND(4, and the thermal pad)  OUTP=OUT+(11)  FBP=FB+(2)
*     OUTN=OUT-(6)  FBN=FB-(7)  CPOUT=CP(5, charge pump output)  C1P=C1+(10)
*     C1N=C1-(9)  ENP=EN+(12)  ENN=EN-(8)  PGOOD=PGOOD(1, open drain, low = good)
*
* LM27762_OPEN_AVG : no switching; the pump is a -VIN source with a load-dependent
*   droop. Use for .op/.dc/.ac and for long transients. C1P/C1N are not used (1 Gohm to GND).
* LM27762_OPEN     : the pump switches (four switches, C1 on C1P/C1N, 2 MHz, pulse
*   skipping at light load). Use for ripple studies; needs .tran with a step of
*   <= 25 ns (the clock is a B-source and has no breakpoints).
* Instance parameters (both): VFBP (1.182/1.2/1.218), VFBN (-1.238/-1.22/-1.202),
*   FSW (1.7e6/2e6/2.3e6; only the switching variant uses it).
* Other tunables are global .param names LM27762_* (override with .param after
*   the .include only if the model's own PROVENANCE.md says what it pins).
* Every constant is a FACTS.md value or a labelled MODELLING CHOICE; see PROVENANCE.md.
*
* Signs: OUTN and CPOUT are negative voltages. The negative LDO passes current from
* OUTN into CPOUT.

* ---- global defaults (FACTS = datasheet row; MC = modelling choice) -----------------
.param LM27762_KGP=20         $ MC: pos gate gain 1/V; sets 11 uV/mA load reg at 1.8 V, VIN 5 V (FACTS 5 load reg OUT+)
.param LM27762_KGN=4.8        $ MC: neg gate gain 1/V; sets 34 uV/mA load reg at -1.8 V, VIN 5 V (FACTS 5 load reg OUT-)
.param LM27762_RDSP=0.47      $ FACTS Fig 5-3 OUT+ 117 mV at 250 mA
.param LM27762_RDSN=0.32      $ FACTS Fig 5-3 OUT- 80 mV at 250 mA
.param LM27762_ILIMP=0.5      $ FACTS Sec 4 positive LDO 500 mA typ
.param LM27762_ILIMN=0.5      $ MC: neg LDO limit not given; the pump's 500 mA input limit bounds it
.param LM27762_ILIMCP=0.5     $ FACTS Sec 4 charge pump 500 mA typ input limit
.param LM27762_IQP=100u       $ MC: split of the 390 uA IQ (FACTS 5): positive LDO bias
.param LM27762_IQNV=90u       $ MC: negative side bias drawn from VIN (reference, oscillator)
.param LM27762_IQNC=200u      $ MC: negative LDO bias drawn from CP (carried to VIN by the pump)
.param LM27762_ISD=0.5u       $ FACTS 5 shutdown current typ
.param LM27762_VEN=0.8        $ MC: threshold between VIL max 0.4 and VIH min 1.2
.param LM27762_REN=10meg      $ MC: enable input resistance (not given)
.param LM27762_UVR=2.6        $ FACTS 4 UVLO rising
.param LM27762_UVF=2.4        $ FACTS 4 UVLO falling
.param LM27762_TSS=50u        $ MC: reference soft-start time constant (not given)
.param LM27762_RPD=50k        $ FACTS 4 output discharge
.param LM27762_RCPD=10k       $ MC: CP discharge in shutdown (not given)
.param LM27762_RPG=100        $ MC: PGOOD pull-down on-resistance (not given)
.param LM27762_PGTH=0.95      $ FACTS 7 PGOOD threshold
.param LM27762_KLP=2.5m       $ MC: reference shift per V of VIN (output falls as VIN rises, FACTS Fig 5-6); 1.9 mV/V is the FACTS line regulation and 0.6 mV/V is added to cancel the pass device's headroom effect so the total over VIN 2.7-5 V at 50 mA is 1.9 mV/V
.param LM27762_KLN=-1.2m      $ MC: reference shift per V of VIN; negative on purpose: the pass device's headroom effect alone is 2.7 mV/V, so this trims the total over VIN 2.7-5 V at 50 mA to FACTS 1.5 mV/V (sign of the FACTS figure: Fig 5-5)
.param LM27762_KHP=0.07       $ MC: high-frequency PSRR path gain, positive LDO (shaped on Fig 7-4)
.param LM27762_FHP=60k        $ MC: corner of the two-pole high-pass of that path
.param LM27762_KHN=0.03       $ MC: same, negative LDO (Fig 7-3)
.param LM27762_FHN=40k        $ MC
.param LM27762_FLP=300k       $ MC: low-pass pole closing the PSRR paths (no data above 100 kHz)
.param LM27762_RSWON=0.3      $ MC: on-resistance of each of the 4 pump switches, tuned so the simulated R at 100-300 mA matches FACTS Fig 5-4 (RNEG 2.5 ohm at 100 mA)
.param LM27762_PFMVH=40m      $ MC: pulse-skip comparator hysteresis, total band in V; with the load it sets the burst spacing (no data)
.param LM27762_IPWM=0.1       $ MC: load above which the pump runs continuously
.param LM27762_TIAV=100u      $ MC: load-current averaging time of the pulse-skip law

* Charge-pump droop (V) vs load current (A) at VIN 5.5 V, 25 C. A smooth monotone fit of FACTS Fig 5-4
* (R*I points 1mA 0.30, 3mA 0.36, 10mA 0.35, 30mA 0.21, 60mA 0.21, 100mA 0.25, 300mA 0.66): the
* pulse-skipping plateau 0.28 V (pool-adjacent-violators mean of the 1-100 mA points, the dip at 30-60 mA
* is not followed because it would be a negative resistance), then ~2.1 ohm of constant-frequency output
* resistance above a 120 mA knee. Zero droop at zero load and the shape under 1 mA are MODELLING
* CHOICES (the figure starts at 1 mA).
.func lm27762_dcp(i) {0.28*tanh(i/0.5m) + 2.11*0.5*((i-0.12)+sqrt((i-0.12)*(i-0.12)+4e-4))}
* g = tanh(max(K*error,0)): the pass current is g*Vds/Rds-on, so in dropout g -> 1 and I = Vds/Rds-on, and
* the small-signal gain is K*Vds/Rds-on (like a triode FET). Load regulation therefore worsens as headroom shrinks.
.func lm27762_gate(k,e) {tanh(0.5*(k*e+sqrt(k*k*e*e+1e-18)))}

* ---- core: UVLO, enables, soft start, both LDOs, discharge, PGOOD ----------------------
.subckt LM27762_OPEN_CORE VIN GND OUTP FBP OUTN FBN CPOUT ENP ENN PGOOD ONP ONN
+ PARAMS: VFBP=1.2 VFBN=-1.22
* UVLO with hysteresis; state held in node uvs (1 = running)
Buv uvr GND V = V(VIN,GND) > (V(uvs,GND) > 0.5 ? {LM27762_UVF} : {LM27762_UVR}) ? 1 : 0
Ruv uvr uvs 100
Cuv uvs GND 10p
Ren1 ENP GND {LM27762_REN}
Ren2 ENN GND {LM27762_REN}
Bonp ONP GND V = (V(ENP,GND) > {LM27762_VEN}) * (V(uvs,GND) > 0.5)
Bonn ONN GND V = (V(ENN,GND) > {LM27762_VEN}) * (V(uvs,GND) > 0.5)
* soft-started references
Brfp rpi GND V = VFBP*V(ONP,GND)
Rrp rpi rfp 1k
Crp rfp GND {LM27762_TSS/1k}
Brfn rni GND V = VFBN*V(ONN,GND)
Rrn rni rfn 1k
Crn rfn GND {LM27762_TSS/1k}
* PSRR paths: two-pole high-pass then one low-pass, from VIN (pos) and CPOUT (neg)
Bhp1 hpa GND V = V(VIN,GND)
Chp1 hpa hpx {1/(6.2831853*LM27762_FHP*1k)}
Rhp1 hpx GND 1k
Bhp2 hpb GND V = V(hpx,GND)
Chp2 hpb hpy {1/(6.2831853*LM27762_FHP*1k)}
Rhp2 hpy GND 1k
Bhp3 hpc GND V = V(hpy,GND)
Rhp3 hpc hpz 1k
Chp3 hpz GND {1/(6.2831853*LM27762_FLP*1k)}
Bhn1 hna GND V = V(CPOUT,GND)
Chn1 hna hnx {1/(6.2831853*LM27762_FHN*1k)}
Rhn1 hnx GND 1k
Bhn2 hnb GND V = V(hnx,GND)
Chn2 hnb hny {1/(6.2831853*LM27762_FHN*1k)}
Rhn2 hny GND 1k
Bhn3 hnc GND V = V(hny,GND)
Rhn3 hnc hnz 1k
Chn3 hnz GND {1/(6.2831853*LM27762_FLP*1k)}
* positive LDO. error = ref - FB + beta*dv, beta = FB/OUT, dv = output shift from line / PSRR
Bep ep GND V = V(rfp,GND) - V(FBP,GND) + V(FBP,GND)/max(V(OUTP,GND),0.1) * (-{LM27762_KLP}*(V(VIN,GND)-5) + {LM27762_KHP}*V(hpz,GND))
Rep ep epf 1k
Cep epf GND 5.3p
Vps VIN vp 0
Bpp vp OUTP I = V(ONP,GND) * lm27762_gate({LM27762_KGP},V(epf,GND)) * (V(VIN,GND)-V(OUTP,GND))/{LM27762_RDSP} / (1+(I(Vps)/{LM27762_ILIMP})**40)
Bpd OUTP GND I = (1-V(ONP,GND)) * V(OUTP,GND)/{LM27762_RPD}
Biqp VIN GND I = V(ONP,GND) * {LM27762_IQP}
* negative LDO: pass current OUTN -> CPOUT
Ben en GND V = V(FBN,GND) - V(rfn,GND) - V(FBN,GND)/min(V(OUTN,GND),-0.1) * (-{LM27762_KLN}*(V(VIN,GND)-5) - {LM27762_KHN}*V(hnz,GND))
Ren en enf 1k
Cen enf GND 5.3p
Vpn OUTN vn 0
Bpn vn CPOUT I = V(ONN,GND) * lm27762_gate({LM27762_KGN},V(enf,GND)) * (V(OUTN,GND)-V(CPOUT,GND))/{LM27762_RDSN} / (1+(I(Vpn)/{LM27762_ILIMN})**40)
Bpu OUTN GND I = (1-V(ONN,GND)) * V(OUTN,GND)/{LM27762_RPD}
Bcd CPOUT GND I = (1-V(ONN,GND)) * V(CPOUT,GND)/{LM27762_RCPD}
Biqnv VIN GND I = V(ONN,GND) * {LM27762_IQNV}
Biqnc GND CPOUT I = V(ONN,GND) * {LM27762_IQNC} * min(max(-V(CPOUT,GND)/0.5,0),1)
Bisd VIN GND I = (1-max(V(ONP,GND),V(ONN,GND))) * {LM27762_ISD}
* PGOOD, open drain, low = good (FACTS 7 table 6-1)
Bpg PGOOD GND I = ((V(ONP,GND)>0.5)||(V(ONN,GND)>0.5)) * (V(ONP,GND)>0.5 ? (V(FBP,GND) > {LM27762_PGTH}*VFBP ? 1 : 0) : 1) * (V(ONN,GND)>0.5 ? (V(FBN,GND) < {LM27762_PGTH}*VFBN ? 1 : 0) : 1) * V(PGOOD,GND)/{LM27762_RPG}
.ends LM27762_OPEN_CORE

* ---- averaged pump ----------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt LM27762_OPEN_PUMPAVG VIN GND CPOUT ONN
Boc ci GND V = -V(VIN,GND)*V(ONN,GND)
* series drop = f(current drawn from CPOUT) + 1 Gohm when off + soft input-current limit
Vs CPOUT x 0
Bd x ci V = lm27762_dcp(0.5*(I(Vs)+sqrt(I(Vs)*I(Vs)+1e-12))) + (1-V(ONN,GND))*1g*I(Vs) + 10*max(I(Vs)-{LM27762_ILIMCP},0)
Bin VIN GND I = V(ONN,GND)*max(I(Vs),0)
.ends LM27762_OPEN_PUMPAVG

* ---- switching pump -----------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt LM27762_OPEN_PUMPSW VIN GND CPOUT C1P C1N ONN PARAMS: FSW=2meg
.model LM27762SW SW(Vt=0.5 Vh=0.1 Ron={LM27762_RSWON} Roff=1e9)
Bclk clk GND V = sin(6.2831853*FSW*time)
Vs CPOUT cx 0
* load estimate for the pulse-skip law: pump output current, averaged
Bia iar GND V = I(Vs)
Ria iar iav 1k
Cia iav GND {LM27762_TIAV/1k}
Bthr thr GND V = lm27762_dcp(max(V(iav,GND),0))*(1-0.5*(1+tanh((V(iav,GND)-{LM27762_IPWM})/(0.1*{LM27762_IPWM})))) - 0.5*(1+tanh((V(iav,GND)-{LM27762_IPWM})/(0.1*{LM27762_IPWM})))
* pulse-skip comparator with memory in node pmp
Bpmr pmpr GND V = (V(ONN,GND)>0.5) * ((V(VIN,GND)+V(CPOUT,GND)) > V(thr,GND)+{LM27762_PFMVH}/2 ? 1 : ((V(VIN,GND)+V(CPOUT,GND)) < V(thr,GND)-{LM27762_PFMVH}/2 ? 0 : V(pmp,GND)))
Rpm pmpr pmp 100
Cpm pmp GND 10p
Bpa pa GND V = 0.5*(1+tanh((V(clk,GND)-0.1)/0.03)) * V(pmp,GND) * V(ONN,GND)
Bpb pb GND V = 0.5*(1+tanh((-V(clk,GND)-0.1)/0.03)) * V(pmp,GND) * V(ONN,GND)
S1 VIN C1P pa GND LM27762SW
S3 C1N GND pa GND LM27762SW
S2 C1P GND pb GND LM27762SW
S4 C1N cx pb GND LM27762SW
Rl1 C1P GND 1g
Rl2 C1N GND 1g
.ends LM27762_OPEN_PUMPSW

* ---- the two top-level variants --------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt LM27762_OPEN_AVG VIN GND OUTP FBP OUTN FBN CPOUT C1P C1N ENP ENN PGOOD
+ PARAMS: VFBP=1.2 VFBN=-1.22 FSW=2meg
Xc VIN GND OUTP FBP OUTN FBN CPOUT ENP ENN PGOOD onp onn LM27762_OPEN_CORE PARAMS: VFBP={VFBP} VFBN={VFBN}
Xp VIN GND CPOUT onn LM27762_OPEN_PUMPAVG
Rl1 C1P GND 1g
Rl2 C1N GND 1g
.ends LM27762_OPEN_AVG

.subckt LM27762_OPEN VIN GND OUTP FBP OUTN FBN CPOUT C1P C1N ENP ENN PGOOD
+ PARAMS: VFBP=1.2 VFBN=-1.22 FSW=2meg
Xc VIN GND OUTP FBP OUTN FBN CPOUT ENP ENN PGOOD onp onn LM27762_OPEN_CORE PARAMS: VFBP={VFBP} VFBN={VFBN}
Xp VIN GND CPOUT C1P C1N onn LM27762_OPEN_PUMPSW PARAMS: FSW={FSW}
.ends LM27762_OPEN
